WEBVTT

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:04.605
Jin, give me Toa.

00:00:04.605 --> 00:00:08.545
It is the only way to save Toa.

00:00:08.545 --> 00:00:10.485
Gio...

00:00:10.485 --> 00:00:12.475
There's no more time.

00:00:14.255 --> 00:00:16.385
You cannot save Toa.

00:00:16.385 --> 00:00:20.555
If Toa goes back to Thanatos,
will she be able to live on?

00:00:20.555 --> 00:00:22.455
- Yeah.
- Then...

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:26.325
However, Toa will not be coming back here.

00:00:26.325 --> 00:00:30.435
Once we return to Thanatos,
we're departing for deep space again.

00:00:30.435 --> 00:00:32.465
She won't come back?

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.995
I will give you one day's time.

00:01:07.175 --> 00:01:12.875
In my younger days, I lost

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:18.785
even the reason for this pain

00:01:18.785 --> 00:01:24.485
Crouching over, making excuses

00:01:24.485 --> 00:01:27.685
I must have...

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:35.395
Taking hold of the premonition
I saw at the end of the blue,

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:43.005
riding the wind, I'm off
to where the light shines

00:01:43.005 --> 00:01:45.845
I'll always be with you

00:01:45.845 --> 00:01:48.345
see the sky in front of you

00:01:48.345 --> 00:01:52.715
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:01:54.515 --> 00:02:00.055
Riding the echo of swirling stars,

00:02:00.055 --> 00:02:02.725
I sing out

00:02:02.725 --> 00:02:11.395
May my voice reach you

00:02:22.945 --> 00:02:23.715
The effects of Thanatos' approach are causing

00:02:23.715 --> 00:02:25.185
"Breaking... Climatic disaster alert."
The effects of Thanatos' approach are causing

00:02:25.185 --> 00:02:25.615
"Advisories... Maritime Warning...
Landslide Warning... News is as follows..."
The effects of Thanatos' approach are causing

00:02:25.615 --> 00:02:27.055
"Advisories... Maritime Warning...
Landslide Warning... News is as follows..."
strange phenomena to occur all over the globe.

00:02:27.055 --> 00:02:27.355
Strange phenomena to occur all over the globe.

00:02:27.355 --> 00:02:29.955
In response, the UN crisis
management administration

00:02:29.955 --> 00:02:32.255
has declared a special state of emergency.

00:02:32.255 --> 00:02:34.755
Early this morning, they requested ISDA

00:02:34.755 --> 00:02:37.625
and the Girouard space force
to launch an attack.

00:02:40.035 --> 00:02:42.735
Dragon Slayer arming complete.

00:02:42.735 --> 00:02:45.235
All right, all ships, prepare to attack.

00:02:45.235 --> 00:02:47.705
- A-Attack?
- Your Excellency.

00:02:47.705 --> 00:02:50.475
Aren't we supposed to be engaging
in a joint operation with the Avenir?

00:02:50.475 --> 00:02:53.715
You expect me to wait for those pantywaists?

00:02:53.715 --> 00:02:57.445
Thanatos, we're going to burn you up.

00:02:57.445 --> 00:02:59.215
Fire!!

00:03:16.395 --> 00:03:18.105
Target remains.

00:03:18.105 --> 00:03:21.435
The result of our attack is... negligible.

00:03:28.315 --> 00:03:30.435
I-Impossible...

00:03:31.985 --> 00:03:35.755
Roughly 28% of the fleet against
Thanatos has been destroyed!

00:03:35.755 --> 00:03:37.985
They are continuing their attack even now.

00:03:37.985 --> 00:03:41.325
That bunch of fools... They jumped the gun.

00:03:41.325 --> 00:03:43.585
The operation has failed!

00:03:44.825 --> 00:03:46.495
Please do not push!

00:03:46.495 --> 00:03:49.835
The shelters outside of Tokyo
can accommodate everyone!

00:03:49.835 --> 00:03:52.135
We're receiving reports that the Girouard Force,

00:03:52.135 --> 00:03:54.275
having carried out its attack,
took heavy damage,

00:03:54.275 --> 00:03:56.365
and the situation grows more serious...

00:04:03.715 --> 00:04:05.345
Toa...

00:04:06.615 --> 00:04:07.815
How's Toa?

00:04:07.815 --> 00:04:11.185
Fine, she's fast asleep now.

00:04:11.185 --> 00:04:12.855
Oh.

00:04:12.855 --> 00:04:15.795
Here, I brought some medicine.

00:04:15.795 --> 00:04:17.995
Thanks, Sigelinde.

00:04:17.995 --> 00:04:20.535
It's all human medicine, though.

00:04:20.535 --> 00:04:22.665
Please be sure to read
the instructions carefully

00:04:22.665 --> 00:04:26.165
before using them, Jin-sama.

00:04:26.165 --> 00:04:28.005
Hold on!

00:04:29.675 --> 00:04:33.815
What are you doing, Amadeus?!
We were about to treat Toa!

00:04:33.815 --> 00:04:36.145
It is unlikely to do any good.

00:04:36.145 --> 00:04:40.355
Yeah, I know that! I know, but...

00:04:40.355 --> 00:04:44.685
Let's allow the two of them to
be alone right now, Young Miss.

00:04:58.105 --> 00:05:00.435
- Shall we go?
- Yeah.

00:05:00.435 --> 00:05:04.675
It sure is huge. We couldn't ask
for a more worthy opponent.

00:05:04.675 --> 00:05:07.015
We're not going off to fight it.

00:05:07.015 --> 00:05:10.385
We're going to tell it once
again that there is a future

00:05:10.385 --> 00:05:13.345
where humans and Dragons live together.

00:05:13.345 --> 00:05:17.125
Our words ought to get through to Gio.

00:05:17.125 --> 00:05:21.625
Well then, we'll have to come along with you.

00:05:21.625 --> 00:05:26.065
We feel the same way that you do, Raina-sama.

00:05:26.065 --> 00:05:29.295
And, once you're there,
if it doesn't listen to you,

00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:32.065
we'll give it a good slap, and wake it up.

00:05:32.065 --> 00:05:34.035
Yes, Young Miss.

00:05:36.075 --> 00:05:39.375
We might not come back from this.

00:05:39.375 --> 00:05:41.075
We're all in this together.

00:05:41.075 --> 00:05:43.885
We're not afraid.

00:05:43.885 --> 00:05:45.475
Guys...

00:05:48.155 --> 00:05:49.775
Are you going?

00:05:54.655 --> 00:05:55.995
Jin...

00:05:55.995 --> 00:05:59.325
All ships, fire, fire, fire away!

00:06:23.155 --> 00:06:25.755
It's so pointless.

00:06:25.755 --> 00:06:29.695
There's no way that the humans'
power could reach Thanatos.

00:06:29.695 --> 00:06:31.925
You've merged with Thanatos, have you?

00:06:31.925 --> 00:06:33.765
Akira... Machina...

00:06:33.765 --> 00:06:37.965
We are the ones who
were once Akira and Machina.

00:06:37.965 --> 00:06:40.475
Names mean nothing for us now.

00:06:40.475 --> 00:06:43.435
I'm a spirit of Thanatos.

00:06:43.435 --> 00:06:46.805
One of countless minds
that have merged with it.

00:06:50.385 --> 00:06:55.655
It's so sad. They are unable to
drown out their fear except by fighting.

00:06:55.655 --> 00:06:57.325
They can't help it.

00:06:57.325 --> 00:07:01.995
Humans are imperfect creatures,
only able to hurt themselves,

00:07:01.995 --> 00:07:04.395
and to hate others.

00:07:04.395 --> 00:07:08.335
Why don't you get it?! Now is
the time for mankind to join forces,

00:07:08.335 --> 00:07:10.705
and launch an attack against Thanatos!

00:07:10.705 --> 00:07:14.335
We won't send our soldiers against
a foe we know nothing about.

00:07:14.335 --> 00:07:16.575
The Girouard Force were the ones

00:07:16.575 --> 00:07:18.845
who started this fight in
the first place, weren't they?

00:07:18.845 --> 00:07:21.015
You take care of it.

00:07:21.015 --> 00:07:23.315
If you want to accuse us
of being responsible for this,

00:07:23.315 --> 00:07:26.315
you first have to think about surviving it.

00:07:26.315 --> 00:07:28.915
If Thanatos comes down on us,
the other side of the Earth

00:07:28.915 --> 00:07:31.515
isn't going to come away unscathed, after all.

00:07:33.025 --> 00:07:37.595
But will our military forces even be of any use?

00:07:37.595 --> 00:07:40.495
If your space forces,
reputed to be the mightiest around,

00:07:40.495 --> 00:07:42.935
couldn't beat that thing...

00:07:42.935 --> 00:07:46.505
We still have an ace in the hole.

00:07:46.505 --> 00:07:50.875
Understood. We will begin prepping
the Annihilator Module for launch.

00:07:50.875 --> 00:07:54.575
To them, the beings known as
Dragons are of a different nature.

00:07:54.575 --> 00:07:56.545
Thus, they don't even try to understand them,

00:07:56.545 --> 00:07:58.845
they just use them as implements of war.

00:07:58.845 --> 00:08:02.415
Are you saying that our contact
with humans was a mistake?

00:08:02.415 --> 00:08:06.355
Still, you like them, right?

00:08:06.355 --> 00:08:10.125
Just as humans have
learned much from Dragons,

00:08:10.125 --> 00:08:16.135
Dragons have also gained
something important, namely, a soul.

00:08:16.135 --> 00:08:18.905
It was by going through Resonance with humans

00:08:18.905 --> 00:08:21.375
that Dragons first learned what a soul is.

00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:23.875
Gio, that goes for you, too.

00:08:23.875 --> 00:08:27.815
She's right. If I hadn't come
in contact with the human soul,

00:08:27.815 --> 00:08:31.885
I wouldn't be what I am now,

00:08:31.885 --> 00:08:35.245
nor would I have known these feelings.

00:08:37.455 --> 00:08:40.385
You monster!!

00:08:45.825 --> 00:08:48.095
Jin... Toa...

00:08:54.605 --> 00:08:56.905
You're awake?

00:08:56.905 --> 00:09:00.675
- Jin...
- ls the pain gone?

00:09:00.675 --> 00:09:02.305
Mm-hmm.

00:09:04.185 --> 00:09:05.685
I'm fine.

00:09:05.685 --> 00:09:07.515
Then, shall we go?

00:09:07.515 --> 00:09:09.145
Yes.

00:09:15.495 --> 00:09:18.495
Jin, do you remember?

00:09:18.495 --> 00:09:22.135
That first day we met?

00:09:22.135 --> 00:09:24.435
How could I forget?

00:09:24.435 --> 00:09:27.835
Toa, it was because of you
that I could go on living.

00:09:53.465 --> 00:09:55.865
Right now, I...

00:09:55.865 --> 00:09:57.855
...am very happy.

00:09:59.805 --> 00:10:02.795
And I am not alone.

00:10:04.705 --> 00:10:06.335
Jin...

00:10:07.975 --> 00:10:10.875
I'm glad I met you.

00:10:14.185 --> 00:10:16.315
Are you finally awake?

00:10:21.155 --> 00:10:23.895
You think you're really something, don't you?

00:10:23.895 --> 00:10:25.695
Kazuki...

00:10:33.405 --> 00:10:36.405
This is the last of your time together.
Make the most of it.

00:10:36.405 --> 00:10:40.105
Are you sure you don't want to say goodbye?

00:10:40.105 --> 00:10:42.415
You do have feelings, right?

00:10:42.415 --> 00:10:46.015
W-Who, me?! For that little man?!

00:10:46.015 --> 00:10:50.855
Oh, I meant for the both of them.

00:10:50.855 --> 00:10:54.555
T-That was nasty!

00:10:54.555 --> 00:10:56.185
Let's go.

00:10:58.125 --> 00:11:00.065
Incarnate!!

00:11:04.305 --> 00:11:07.095
Howling Star, take off!

00:11:09.475 --> 00:11:11.305
Actualize!

00:11:15.715 --> 00:11:18.205
Otohime, are you ready?

00:11:23.785 --> 00:11:26.775
- Young Miss...
- I know.

00:11:35.635 --> 00:11:37.395
Amadeus!

00:11:44.575 --> 00:11:46.165
Bye-bye.

00:11:51.945 --> 00:11:53.645
You're impossible.

00:11:53.645 --> 00:11:57.455
You go to kill Toa, and you
almost get yourself killed.

00:11:57.455 --> 00:11:59.355
Kazuki...

00:12:01.425 --> 00:12:03.495
Get the hell up already!

00:12:03.495 --> 00:12:06.425
You don't serve any purpose
except for fighting, you know!

00:12:06.425 --> 00:12:08.525
I don't know why I put up with you.

00:12:14.605 --> 00:12:17.845
An emergency evacuation
advisory has just been issued.

00:12:17.845 --> 00:12:19.775
We would ask anyone who
is watching this broadcast

00:12:19.775 --> 00:12:22.865
that if you have not yet taken shelter,
please proceed at once to...

00:12:26.785 --> 00:12:31.355
If only we could stop time like this.

00:12:31.355 --> 00:12:32.685
It's all right.

00:12:32.685 --> 00:12:36.855
Toa, you aren't going to die.

00:12:36.855 --> 00:12:39.125
You knew, Jin?!

00:12:43.495 --> 00:12:46.805
- Lt's time.
- Gio!

00:12:46.805 --> 00:12:51.205
This time for sure...
this time for sure, I'll hunt them down...

00:12:51.205 --> 00:12:53.035
I swear...

00:12:54.245 --> 00:12:57.715
Let's bring an end to this now.

00:12:57.715 --> 00:13:04.025
Kazuki... I'm sorry I couldn't understand you...

00:13:04.025 --> 00:13:07.595
You loved Jin, didn't you?

00:13:07.595 --> 00:13:14.255
If so, then don't hurt yourself anymore.

00:13:16.935 --> 00:13:20.735
If only I had gone through Resonance with you...

00:13:20.735 --> 00:13:24.105
...I would have understood you...

00:13:24.105 --> 00:13:25.935
...better...

00:13:35.885 --> 00:13:38.455
We're going back to Thanatos, Toa.

00:13:38.455 --> 00:13:41.095
Gio... Jin!

00:13:41.095 --> 00:13:46.095
Toa, this was the only way to save you!

00:13:46.095 --> 00:13:48.365
No! I don't want to!

00:13:48.365 --> 00:13:51.805
I'd rather be next to you,

00:13:51.805 --> 00:13:54.135
right up to the last second, Jin!

00:13:55.605 --> 00:13:58.745
Gio, take care of Toa.

00:13:58.745 --> 00:14:00.365
Jin!

00:14:07.655 --> 00:14:09.715
This is...

00:14:09.715 --> 00:14:11.555
This is for the best.

00:14:23.265 --> 00:14:26.065
Jin!

00:14:26.065 --> 00:14:29.175
- Kazuki...
- Widow is dead.

00:14:29.175 --> 00:14:30.675
Widow?

00:14:30.675 --> 00:14:32.575
Where is Toa?

00:14:32.575 --> 00:14:35.515
She went back to Thanatos.

00:14:35.515 --> 00:14:38.245
I'm alone again.

00:14:38.245 --> 00:14:42.255
So he saved Toa, but killed Widow.

00:14:42.255 --> 00:14:43.985
- Kazuki?
- Why?!

00:14:43.985 --> 00:14:47.495
Why did it end up like this?!

00:14:47.495 --> 00:14:50.995
I just wanted to protect you, Jin!

00:14:50.995 --> 00:14:55.035
Gio was... Gio was my ideal Dragon!

00:14:55.035 --> 00:14:58.705
He was pure power, to protect you, Jin!

00:14:58.705 --> 00:15:00.435
So why did he kill Widow?!

00:15:00.435 --> 00:15:02.505
It's all your fault, Jin!

00:15:02.505 --> 00:15:06.275
I've lost everything because of you!

00:15:07.945 --> 00:15:10.675
I'm the one who's lost everything!

00:15:10.675 --> 00:15:14.355
My dad, my mom, Ai... everyone!

00:15:14.355 --> 00:15:17.685
Toa was the only one I had left!

00:15:17.685 --> 00:15:19.555
You dumb ass!

00:15:19.555 --> 00:15:22.795
Toa is not human! She's a Dragon!

00:15:22.795 --> 00:15:27.055
It doesn't matter! I love Toa!

00:15:28.165 --> 00:15:32.305
I don't care if no one else understands.

00:15:32.305 --> 00:15:36.335
After all, we don't even
understand each other anymore!

00:15:36.335 --> 00:15:37.995
I do understand!

00:15:44.145 --> 00:15:50.215
I understand... finally...
now that Widow is dead...

00:15:50.215 --> 00:15:54.355
...how much we've lost...

00:15:54.355 --> 00:15:55.985
Kazuki...

00:15:58.325 --> 00:16:08.235
I understand, but I can't tell her...
thank you, or sorry, or goodbye...

00:16:08.235 --> 00:16:13.605
And so, Jin... Jin, I don't want you...

00:16:13.605 --> 00:16:17.845
...to have to go through this anymore...

00:16:17.845 --> 00:16:19.715
Kazuki...

00:16:19.715 --> 00:16:22.845
I'm sorry... I'm sorry!

00:16:33.465 --> 00:16:35.565
Toa...

00:16:35.565 --> 00:16:38.635
"I'd rather be next to you,
right up to the last second."

00:16:38.635 --> 00:16:41.935
That's what you told me,

00:16:41.935 --> 00:16:44.965
and yet, I...

00:16:48.615 --> 00:16:51.545
Kazuki, thanks.

00:16:53.115 --> 00:16:54.555
Jin...

00:16:54.555 --> 00:16:57.415
I have to go.

00:16:59.255 --> 00:17:04.725
I have to be with Toa, right up to the end.

00:17:04.725 --> 00:17:08.395
- Jin...
- You're right.

00:17:08.395 --> 00:17:10.335
It's not over yet.

00:17:10.335 --> 00:17:12.425
Commander Sakaki!

00:17:13.765 --> 00:17:15.275
All right, you!

00:17:15.275 --> 00:17:17.235
What do you think you're doing with my ship?!

00:17:17.235 --> 00:17:19.945
We're going to use the Aegis
to stop Thanatos in its tracks,

00:17:19.945 --> 00:17:23.675
and then finish it off with a shuttle,
carrying the Annihilator.

00:17:23.675 --> 00:17:27.185
Do you think I'm going to permit you
to carry out such an arbitrary plan?

00:17:27.185 --> 00:17:30.315
Decrepit as I am, I'm still
the director of ISDA!

00:17:30.315 --> 00:17:33.655
I have a responsibility to
protect this ship and its crew!

00:17:33.655 --> 00:17:36.425
- Director!
- Out of the way!

00:17:37.925 --> 00:17:39.495
Director!

00:17:39.495 --> 00:17:42.935
Old fool! Don't you move, either!

00:17:56.145 --> 00:17:57.885
Protect the Director!

00:17:57.885 --> 00:17:59.505
Right!

00:18:01.485 --> 00:18:03.315
What's with these girls?!

00:18:03.315 --> 00:18:04.945
Don't forget me!

00:18:09.895 --> 00:18:11.565
I see stars...

00:18:11.565 --> 00:18:14.465
I told you, you have to change
the main hatch's security code

00:18:14.465 --> 00:18:17.865
every day, didn't I?

00:18:17.865 --> 00:18:19.835
Y-You guys...

00:18:19.835 --> 00:18:24.235
Long time no see, Director.
We've come to ask a favor.

00:18:25.975 --> 00:18:28.745
Annihilator Module loading complete.

00:18:28.745 --> 00:18:30.545
All right, let's launch it.

00:18:30.545 --> 00:18:32.175
Sir!

00:18:37.415 --> 00:18:39.515
C-Commander?

00:18:42.755 --> 00:18:45.395
Are you all right?

00:18:45.395 --> 00:18:46.895
You have a terrible fever.

00:18:46.895 --> 00:18:50.365
It's the effects of the
anti-Thanatos factor, most likely.

00:18:50.365 --> 00:18:56.075
You guys get the shuttle launched.
I'll work the flight control. Hurry!

00:18:56.075 --> 00:18:58.945
- Commander...
- Let's go, Kazuki!

00:18:58.945 --> 00:19:01.565
Mm-hmm. If you please!

00:19:06.215 --> 00:19:08.615
You traitor...

00:19:17.125 --> 00:19:19.625
Shoot the intruders! I don't care who they are!

00:19:19.625 --> 00:19:21.255
Up there!

00:19:25.605 --> 00:19:27.635
- What is that?!
- Fire!

00:19:27.635 --> 00:19:29.365
Fire! Fire!

00:19:33.275 --> 00:19:35.245
Can you pilot this?

00:19:35.245 --> 00:19:38.315
You ought to give the
Dragonauts a little more credit.

00:19:38.315 --> 00:19:39.945
Condition green. We can launch.

00:19:39.945 --> 00:19:42.885
All right, preparing for takeoff.

00:19:42.885 --> 00:19:46.925
- Commander...
- I'm staying here.

00:19:46.925 --> 00:19:51.965
Watching you, I decided
that at the end, at least,

00:19:51.965 --> 00:19:55.935
I would face myself, and not run away.

00:19:55.935 --> 00:19:59.265
I think that maybe the act of Resonance

00:19:59.265 --> 00:20:03.005
was a chance that was given to me by Thanatos.

00:20:03.005 --> 00:20:07.445
Communicators are our desires,
given physical form.

00:20:07.445 --> 00:20:10.075
In other words, they're what we seek after,

00:20:10.075 --> 00:20:13.745
as well as what we should strive to be.

00:20:13.745 --> 00:20:18.285
When we accept Resonance, and face ourselves,

00:20:18.285 --> 00:20:24.155
we might be able to overcome
our indecision, and our past.

00:20:24.155 --> 00:20:29.835
Ultimately, that was the
answer I got out of it, so...

00:20:29.835 --> 00:20:35.135
...go on, and find your own answers.

00:20:35.135 --> 00:20:36.475
Commander...

00:20:36.475 --> 00:20:38.335
Start roll!

00:20:44.315 --> 00:20:46.175
Right up to the end...

00:20:49.815 --> 00:20:52.685
You've always been the one to help me.

00:20:55.655 --> 00:20:59.685
You are free now. You may go wherever you like.

00:21:01.695 --> 00:21:04.165
I...

00:21:04.165 --> 00:21:05.995
...will always...

00:21:13.975 --> 00:21:18.315
...be with you... Dad...

00:21:22.355 --> 00:21:24.725
You still...

00:21:24.725 --> 00:21:29.685
...call me... Dad?

00:21:32.095 --> 00:21:37.365
Thank you, Laura. I love you.

00:21:50.945 --> 00:21:53.915
I will carry on...

00:21:53.915 --> 00:21:56.245
...the anti-Thanatos factor.

00:22:19.445 --> 00:22:21.715
You don't even think hard about the meaning

00:22:21.715 --> 00:22:23.975
of the words you spit out

00:22:23.975 --> 00:22:28.315
you just run away from the present

00:22:28.315 --> 00:22:30.585
Still doing the same things over and over,

00:22:30.585 --> 00:22:32.725
like nothing has happened

00:22:32.725 --> 00:22:36.395
It makes no sense to run away again

00:22:36.395 --> 00:22:45.265
In the end, you're immature,
still a child, complacent

00:22:45.265 --> 00:22:54.675
Leave behind your old self already

00:22:54.675 --> 00:22:59.185
The righteous fight starts within you

00:22:59.185 --> 00:23:03.615
What would you do?
You're out of time, aren't you?

00:23:03.615 --> 00:23:08.655
Try to remember how you're supposed to be

00:23:08.655 --> 00:23:15.795
before it all falls apart

00:23:15.795 --> 00:23:21.925
Fight or flight

00:23:24.605 --> 00:23:29.375
Fight or flight

00:23:42.895 --> 00:23:45.395
Things sure have taken an incredible turn!

00:23:45.395 --> 00:23:47.465
I wonder what's going to happen now.

00:23:47.465 --> 00:23:49.795
It's times like this we turn to fortune telling.

00:23:49.795 --> 00:23:51.805
I've been training out in
front of the train station.

00:23:51.805 --> 00:23:54.135
Sounds shady!

00:23:55.375 --> 00:23:58.845
I'm getting something! I see a broken
rubber band, and golden downy hair!

00:23:58.845 --> 00:24:00.805
W-What does that mean?

00:24:00.805 --> 00:24:05.515
What it means is, next time,
the Earth gets in a tight squeeze!

00:24:05.515 --> 00:24:09.145
How do you get that?!
